 annotations. However, when invoking the Rest client service from MultipartClientResource class in the example the writer provider is needed as well.\r\nA solution might be to search for the `@RestClient `annotation when registering providers. In case `@RestClient` annotation is found register writer providers (in addition to reader) for all `@Consumes` annotations in the client service.\r\n@gsmet what do you think?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/605529658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"irenakezic","id":56878298,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODc4Mjk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56878298?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic","html_url":"https://github.com/irenakezic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/irenakezic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3175396461,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MzE3NTM5NjQ2MQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/3175396461","actor":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gi